    "causal_summary": "The convention said to declare phrases of two or more tokens and never to index bare numbers or generic words, and nothing enforced the first two rules anywhere: the committed index carried 352 single-token keys across 826 documents, 42 of them only numbers, and sweep-produced fragments such as `ation` passed the judge, the validator, the generator and the doctor",
